# Drives the cmsis-nn SCF MLIR -> DFG MLIR lower pipeline from lit.
# The runner script lives in test/cmsis-nn/; this lit case is the
# single integration point so the lower pipeline runs alongside the
# rest of the regression suite. We pin LOOM_CC, LOOM_RAISE, LOOM_LOWER,
# and LOOM_RAISE_OPT explicitly because lit may run with a clean PATH.
# The bash -c wrapper turns on pipefail so a runner exit-nonzero before
# the summary line still propagates failure through the FileCheck pipe.
#
# The all-pass summary is gating; the dataflow-emission footer is
# pinned to the current denominator so a regression that wholesale
# drops thread/graph emission across the corpus trips the test.
#
# RUN: bash -c 'set -o pipefail; env LOOM_CC=%loom-cc LOOM_RAISE=%loom-raise LOOM_LOWER=%loom-lower LOOM_RAISE_OPT=%loom-raise-opt bash %S/../cmsis-nn/run_cmsis_nn_dfg.sh' | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: ==== cmsis-nn dfg smoke summary ====
# CHECK: all 18 cmsis-nn source(s) passed loom-lower
# CHECK: {{[0-9]+}} of 18 cmsis-nn source(s) emitted dataflow.thread or dataflow.graph.func
